            'en' => ['At Alwrraq, we strive to provide printing and binding services at the best possible quality. Because most orders are custom-made according to files and specifications selected by the customer, cancellation and refunds are subject to the following terms, while observing the rights guaranteed by the laws and regulations applicable in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.'],
